                                     Story Board
A Story Board is a visual representation of Agile work items that helps teams track their status and monitor work progress.

Why do we need a STORY Board?
- To visualize the progress of Stories.
- To understand which work is pending.
- To identify work currently in progress.
- To see completed work.
- To help the team monitor its iteration.

